>>Q000381 025 
26. nibru{ki} uru2 gissu dagal-la-bi-sze3 
#tr.en: - Nibru, the city where, in its spreading shade, 
>>Q000381 026 
27. ug3 sag-ge6-ga ni2 im-szi-ib2-te-en-na 
