#tr.en: Your temple is a shimmering mountain; your very name is merciful. 
>>Q000391 010 
11. en-zu en sig7-ga mu pa3-da 
#tr.en: Your lord is the one called as the beautiful lord, 
>>Q000391 011 
12. dumu {d}nin-sumun2 me-te kur-kur-ra 
