1. di-da-mu-ne di-da-mu-ne 
>>Q000628 001 
#tr.en: When I was going, when I was going. 
2. ga-sza-an-ir9{+i-ra}-ra mu-lu2-u3?-ne 
>>Q000628 002 
#tr.en: When I, the almighty lady of all mankind(?) 
3. ga-sza-an-gen abzu-sze3 di-da-mu-ne 
>>Q000628 003 
#tr.en: - I am the lady - was going to the Abzu. 
4. ga-sza-an-an-na-gen abzu-sze3 di-da-mu-ne 
>>Q000628 004 
#tr.en: When I - I am the lady of heaven - was going to the Abzu. 
5. abzu e2-nun-sze3 di-da-mu-ne 
>>Q000628 005 
#tr.en: When I was going to the Abzu, the prince(ly) house. 
6. uru2-ze2-eb{ki}-ze2-eb-sze3 di-da-mu-ne 
>>Q000628 006 
#tr.en: When I was going to sweet Eridu. 
7. e2-engur-ra-sze3 di-da-mu-ne 
>>Q000628 007 
#tr.en: When I was going to the House-of-the-Sweet-Waters. 
8. e2-an-na e2 {d}mu-ul-lil2-la2-sze3 di-da-mu-ne 
>>Q000628 008 
#tr.en: When I was going to the House-of-Heaven, the house of Enlil. 
9. ne-sag u4-de3 sza3-ge pa3?-sze3 di-da-mu-ne 
>>Q000628 009 
#tr.en: When I was going to where the first-fruit offerings are brought in daily. 
10. bur-gal-gal an-ne2 su8-ga-sze3 di-da-mu-ne 
>>Q000628 010 
#tr.en: When I was going to where large bowls have been placed outdoors. 
11. bur szu-sikil-e ze2-eg3-ga2-sze3 di-da-mu-ne 
>>Q000628 011 
#tr.en: When I was going to where jars have been offered by a pure hand. 
12. a mu-lu-zi-de3 szu e3-ba-sze3 di-da-mu-ne 
>>Q000628 012 
#tr.en: When I was going to where the righteous man raised (his) hand. 
13. u3-mu-un {d}am-an-ki szu e3-ba-sze3 di-da-mu-ne 
>>Q000628 013 
#tr.en: When I was going to where the lord Enki raised (his) hand. 
14. {d}dam-gal-nun-na-ke4 szu e3-ba-sze3 di-da-mu-ne 
>>Q000628 014 
