15. {d}asar-e abzu?-ke4? szu e-ba-sze3 di-da-mu-ne 
>>Q000628 015 
#tr.en: When I was going to where Asar (in?) the Abzu? raised (his) hand. 
16. ur mu-da-ri PIRIG? mu-da-ri 
>>Q000628 016 
