18. ga-sza-an-an-na-gen im-tur-tur-e szu i-im-ti 
>>Q000628 018 
#tr.en: I am the Lady-of-Heaven, I accepted the breezes(?). 
19. e-re7{+re}-da-mu-ne e-re7-da-mu-ne 
>>Q000628 019 
#tr.en: When I bring it along (with me), when I bring it along (with me). 
20. a-e3 me-e gen-na a-e3 me-e gen-na 
>>Q000628 020 
#tr.en: Gushing water I am indeed, gushing water I am indeed. 
21. ga-sza-an-gen ambar-ra di-da-mu-ne 
>>Q000628 021 
#tr.en: When I - I am the lady - was strolling about the marshes, 
22. ambar{+a-bar-ra}-ra a12?-ra2?-bu{muszen}-bi me-e gen-na 
>>Q000628 022 
#tr.en: I am indeed the arabu?-bird of the marshes. 
23. ka-me3-ka di-da-mu-ne 
>>Q000628 023 
#tr.en: When I was going at the opening of the battle, 
24. u4 u4 u4 e3-a-bi gen-na 
>>Q000628 024 
#tr.en: I am forthcoming day-day-daylight. 
25. igi-me3-ka di-da-mu-ne 
>>Q000628 025 
#tr.en: When I am going in front of the battle, 
26. u4 u4 e3-a-bi gen-na 
>>Q000628 026 
#tr.en: I am forthcoming day-daylight. 
27. egir-me3-ka us2-sa-mu-ne 
>>Q000628 027 
#tr.en: When I was following the battle, 
28. kusz7 em3 hul-bi ze2-ba? gen-na 
>>Q000628 028 
#tr.en: I am devastation that rose up wickedly. 
29. e2-{d}mu-ul-lil2-la2 ku4-ra-mu-ne 
>>Q000628 029 
#tr.en: When I was entering the house of Enlil, 
30. munus kur-ra diri-ga-bi gen-na 
>>Q000628 030 
#tr.en: I am a woman who is surpassing the mountain. 
31. kur-kur-ra KA me-ri ba-ni-in-ne 
>>Q000628 031 
#tr.en: Against the mountain ranges I(?) speak angry words(?). 
32. mu-ud-da-na-mu igi-ma3 ba-e-tusz 
>>Q000628 032 
#tr.en: My husband took his place in front of me. 
33. e2-de3? {d}utu?-de3 a-da-min3 mu-un-de3-ne 
>>Q000628 033 
#tr.en: Against(?) the house, against Utu(?), they take part in combat. 
34. {d}utu-de3 {d}nanna-de3 a-da-min3 mu-de3-ne 
>>Q000628 034 
#tr.en: Against Utu (and) Nanna they take part in combat. 
35. {d}sud3 ASZ a-{uruda}szen-dilim2-ku3-ga-ta a-da-min3 mu-de3-ne 
>>Q000628 035 
#tr.en: Against Sud, the one, with the water of the holy dish they take part in combat. 
