65. am szi-ka-na-ag2-ga2 mu-lu2-bi de3-en-ti 
>>Q000628 065 
#tr.en: O lord, life of the land, I will revive that man. 
66. em3 ni2-bi em3 ni2-bi de3-ak 
>>Q000628 066 
#tr.en: I will make things alone(?), things alone(?). 
67. lu2-bi e2-nun-na KA inim-si-sa2 de3-bi2-in-ak 
>>Q000628 067 
#tr.en: For its men I will make a firm promise in the cella. 
68. a-ga-e2-gal-la2-ka inim-si-sa2 im-be2-en-na 
>>Q000628 068 
#tr.en: (Whatever) it is that you say as firm promise in the rear part of the palace. 
69. in-nin9 ubur-zu gan2-ne2-zu he2-a 
>>Q000628 069 
#tr.en: O Inanna, your breast is indeed your field. 
70. {d}inanna ubur-zu gan2-ne2-zu he2-a 
>>Q000628 070 
#tr.en: O Inanna, your breast is indeed your field. 
71. gan2-ne2 dagal-e gu de2-a-zu 
>>Q000628 071 
#tr.en: When you poured out flax in the wide field. 
72. gan2-ne2 dagal-e sze de2-a-zu 
>>Q000628 072 
#tr.en: When you poured out barley in the wide field. 
73. a bala-am3-ta mu-lu2 SZE gar-am3-ta 
>>Q000628 073 
